# M4 Validation: Separation & Security

**Date:** 2026-05-30
**Milestone:** M4 - Separation & Security
**Status:** VALIDATED

## Summary

The platform's security foundation is complete with JWT authentication, organization isolation, CORS hardening, and audit dashboard separation. All critical security gaps identified in the assessment have been addressed.

## Security Components Validated

### 1. JWT Authentication (T-301)
- **Status:** COMPLETED
- **File:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/cyberrx-api/src/middleware/auth.js`
- **Features:**
  - JWT verification middleware
  - Token expiration handling
  - User identity extraction
  - Optional JWT for public endpoints
- **Acceptance:** ACC-04-01 (Every /api/* route except /health rejects requests without valid JWT)

### 2. Organization Isolation (T-302)
- **Status:** COMPLETED
- **File:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/cyberrx-api/src/middleware/org_isolation.js`
- **Features:**
  - X-Org-Id header validation against JWT claim
  - 403 response on mismatch
  - Org scoping for all data queries
- **Acceptance:** ACC-04-02 (X-Org-Id header must match JWT orgId claim)

### 3. CORS Hardening (T-303)
- **Status:** COMPLETED
- **File:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/cyberrx-api/src/index.js`
- **Features:**
  - Environment-based allowlist (CORS_ALLOWLIST or FRONTEND_URL)
  - Localhost URLs allowed in development mode
  - Origin validation callback
  - No "allow all - tighten in production" TODO
- **Acceptance:** ACC-04-03 (CORS allowlist from FRONTEND_URL only)

### 4. Authentication Endpoints (T-304, T-305)
- **Status:** COMPLETED
- **File:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/cyberrx-api/src/routes/auth.js`
- **Features:**
  - POST /api/auth/login with rate limiting (5 attempts/min/IP)
  - JWT issuance on successful authentication
  - POST /api/auth/signup with org-scoping
  - No cross-org signup allowed
  - GET /api/auth/me for current user info
- **Acceptance:** ACC-04-04, ACC-04-05

### 5. Internal Audit Dashboard (T-306, T-307, T-308)
- **Status:** COMPLETED
- **File:** `/Users/briandibassinga/Github/Cyber-Rx/frontend/src/pages/AuditDash.jsx`
- **Features:**
  - Separate /audit route (not combined with CRO)
  - Audit universe map visualization
  - Control testing UI (test plan, procedure, evidence, result)
  - Findings management (issue log, severity, MAP, target, status)
  - Repeat-finding detection
- **Acceptance:** ACC-04-06, ACC-04-07, ACC-04-08, ACC-04-09

